[{"answer":"We went into the church and sat down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/1.mp3"},{"answer":"There were pretty flowers at the front.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/2.mp3"},{"answer":"There was beautiful organ music playing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/3.mp3"},{"answer":"The church was full of people dressed up nicely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone was waiting to see the beautiful bride walk up the aisle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/5.mp3"},{"answer":"A hush, and intake of breath.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/6.mp3"},{"answer":"There she was!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, she was so beautiful!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/8.mp3"},{"answer":"She had a lovely, long white dress with pretty lace and beads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Her hair was swept up off from her face.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/10.mp3"},{"answer":"There were curls flowing down her back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Instead of a veil, she had little flowers in her hair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Her bouquet of tiny flowers was very, very pretty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Her dad looked very proud of her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/14.mp3"},{"answer":"He looked just a little sad, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/15.mp3"},{"answer":"At the front of the church, the groom stood waiting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/16.mp3"},{"answer":"He had a beautiful tender smile on his face.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/17.mp3"},{"answer":"He took his bride's hand as her dad left her there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/18.mp3"},{"answer":"They smiled at each other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/19.mp3"},{"answer":"The minister read, prayed and offered some words of advice to the lovely couple.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Someone sang a pretty song.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/21.mp3"},{"answer":"The groom slipped the simple wedding band on the bride's finger.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/22.mp3"},{"answer":"She struggled a little to put a band on his finger.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Pretty soon the minister said they were now husband and wife.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/24.mp3"},{"answer":"They kissed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/25.mp3"},{"answer":"We all stood, as they walked down the aisle","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/26.mp3"},{"answer":"to live the rest of their lives together as Mr. and Mrs.!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/27.mp3"},{"answer":"We cried.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/130-the-wedding-2019-04-07-04-22-40/28.mp3"}]
